Package: outlying
Title: Outliers Detection
Version: 0.0.2
Authors@R: 
    person("Joon-Keat", "Lai", , "p10911004@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: 
	Provides functions for detecting outliers in datasets using statistical methods. 
    The package supports identification of anomalous observations in numerical data and 
    is intended for use in data cleaning, exploratory data analysis, and preprocessing workflows.
